+  "no": "8.1",
+  "title": "Operational planning and control",
+  "clause": "The organization shall plan, implement and control the processes, as outlined in 4.4, needed to meet requirements for the provision of products and services and to implement the actions determined in 6.1, by:\na) determining requirements for the product and services;\nb) establishing criteria for the processes and for the acceptance of products and services;\nc) determining the resources needed to achieve conformity to product and service requirements;\nd) implementing control of the processes in accordance with the criteria;\ne) retaining documented information to the extent necessary to have confidence that the processes have been carried out as planned and to demonstrate conformity of products and services to requirements.",
+  "task": "How are processes needed to meet requirements for provision of products and services planned, implemented and controlled?\nHow are requirements for products and services determined?\nHow is criteria for processes and acceptance for products and services determined?\nHow are resources determined?\nHow is process control implemented?\nShow me the documented information that shows confidence in that the processes have been carried out as planned and can demonstrate conformity of products and services.\n應備證據：Documented information to show processes have been carried out as planned and can demonstrate conformity of products and services."
+ },
+ {
+  "id": "iso9001-8.1-2",
+  "no": "8.1",
+  "title": "Operational planning and control",
+  "clause": "The output of this planning shall be suitable for the organization's operations.",
+  "task": "How have you determined that the output from the planning process is suitable for your operations?"
+ },
+ {
+  "id": "iso9001-8.1-3",
+  "no": "8.1",
+  "title": "Operational planning and control",
+  "clause": "The organization shall control planned changes and review the consequences of unintended changes, taking action to mitigate any adverse effects, as necessary.",
+  "task": "How do you control planned changes? How do you review the consequences of unintended changes? What action is taken to mitigate any adverse effects?"
+ },
+ {
+  "id": "iso9001-8.1-4",
+  "no": "8.1",
+  "title": "Operational planning and control",
+  "clause": "The organization shall ensure that outsourced processes are controlled in accordance with 8.4.",
+  "task": "How do you control outsourced processes?"
+ },
+ {
+  "id": "iso9001-8.2.1-1",
+  "no": "8.2.1",
+  "title": "Customer communication",
+  "clause": "The organization shall establish the processes for communicating with customers in relation to:\na) information relating to products and services;\nb) enquiries, contracts or order handling, including changes;\nc) obtaining customer views and perceptions, including customer complaints;\nd) the handling or treatment of customer property, if applicable;\ne) specific requirements for contingency actions, when relevant.",
+  "task": "What are your processes for communicating with customers? How do you communicate information relating to:\nProducts;\nServices;\nEnquiries;\nContracts;\nOrder handling;\nCustomer views, perceptions and complaints;\nHandling or treatment of customer property;\nSpecific requirements for contingency actions?"
+ },
+ {
+  "id": "iso9001-8.2.2-1",
+  "no": "8.2.2",
+  "title": "Determination of requirements related to products and services",
+  "clause": "The organization shall establish, implement and maintain a process to determine the requirements for the products and services to be offered to potential customers.",
+  "task": "What is your process to determine the requirements for products and services to be offered to potential customers? How do you establish, implement and maintain this process?"
+ },
+ {
+  "id": "iso9001-8.2.2-2",
+  "no": "8.2.2",
+  "title": "Determination of requirements related to products and services",
+  "clause": "The organization shall ensure that:\na) product and service requirements (including those considered necessary by the organization), and applicable statutory and regulatory requirements, are defined;\nb) it has the ability to meet the defined requirements and substantiate the claims for the products and services it offers.",
+  "task": "How do you define product and service requirements including statutory and regulatory requirements?\nHow do you ensure that you have the ability to meet the defined requirements and substantiate any claims for your products and services?"
+ },
+ {
+  "id": "iso9001-8.2.3-1",
+  "no": "8.2.3",
+  "title": "Review of requirements related to products and services",
+  "clause": "The organization shall review, as applicable:\na) requirements specified by the customer, including the requirements for delivery and post- delivery activities;\nb) requirements not stated by the customer, but necessary for the customers' specified or intended use, when known;\nc) additional statutory and regulatory requirements applicable to the products and services;\nd) contract or order requirements differing from those previously expressed.",
+  "task": "How do you review:\nCustomer requirements for delivery and post-delivery?\nRequirements necessary for customers' specified or intended use, where known;\nAdditional statutory and regulatory requirements applicable to products and services;\nAny other contract or order requirements."
+ },
+ {
+  "id": "iso9001-8.2.3-2",
+  "no": "8.2.3",
+  "title": "Review of requirements related to products and services",
+  "clause": "This review shall be conducted prior to the organization’s commitment to supply products and services to the customer and shall ensure contract or order requirements differing from those previously defined are resolved.",
+  "task": "Show me that the review is conducted prior to your commitment to supply products and services to your customers. How do you resolve contract or order requirements which differ from those previously defined?"
+ },
+ {
+  "id": "iso9001-8.2.3-3",
+  "no": "8.2.3",
+  "title": "Review of requirements related to products and services",
+  "clause": "Where the customer does not provide a documented statement of their requirements, the customer requirements shall be confirmed by the organization before acceptance.",
+  "task": "How do you confirm customer requirements where the customer does not provide a documented statement?"
+ },
+ {
+  "id": "iso9001-8.2.3-4",
+  "no": "8.2.3",
+  "title": "Review of requirements related to products and services",
+  "clause": "Documented information describing the results of the review, including any new or changed requirements for the products and services, shall be retained.",
+  "task": "Show me where you retain documented information which describes results of the review including any new or changed requirements.\n應備證據：Documented information of reviews describing new or changed requirements to products and services."
+ },
+ {
+  "id": "iso9001-8.2.3-5",
+  "no": "8.2.3",
+  "title": "Review of requirements related to products and services",
+  "clause": "Where requirements for products and services are changed, the organization shall ensure that relevant documented information is amended and that relevant personnel are made aware of the changed requirements.",
+  "task": "Show me the documented information containing changes to products and services. How do you ensure that relevant personnel are made aware of those changes?\n應備證據：Documented information of amended reviews and how relevant personnel are made aware of those changes."
+ },
+ {
+  "id": "iso9001-8.3.1-1",
+  "no": "8.3.1",
+  "title": "General",
+  "clause": "Where the detailed requirements of the organization’s products and services are not already established or not defined by the customer or by other interested parties, such that they are adequate for subsequent production or service provision, the organization shall establish, implement and maintain a design and development process.",
+  "task": "How do you establish, implement and maintain a design and development process (where detailed requirements of your products and services are not already established or defined by the customer or other parties)."
+ },
+ {
+  "id": "iso9001-8.3.2-1",
+  "no": "8.3.2",
+  "title": "Design and development planning",
+  "clause": "In determining the stages and controls for design and development, the organization shall consider:\na) the nature, duration and complexity of the design and development activities;\nb) requirements that specify particular process stages, including applicable design and development reviews;\nc) the required design and development verification and validation;\nd) the responsibilities and authorities involved in the design and development process;\ne) the need to control interfaces between individuals and parties involved in the design and development process;\nf) the need for involvement of customer and user groups in the design and development process;\ng) the necessary documented information to confirm that design and development requirements have been met.",
+  "task": "When determining the stages and control for design and development, show me how you consider:\nThe nature, duration and complexity of the activities;\nRequirements that specify particular process stages including applicable reviews;\nRequired verification and validation;\nResponsibilities and authorities;\nHow interfaces are controlled between individuals and parties;\nThe need for involvement of customer and user groups.\nShow me documented information that confirms design and development requirements have been met.\n應備證據：Documented information that confirms design & development requirements have been met."
+ },
+ {
+  "id": "iso9001-8.3.3-1",
+  "no": "8.3.3",
+  "title": "Design and development inputs",
+  "clause": "The organization shall determine:\na) requirements essential for the specific type of products and services being designed and developed, including, as applicable, functional and performance requirements;\nb) applicable statutory and regulatory requirements;\nc) standards or codes of practice that the organization has committed to implement;\nd) internal and external resource needs for the design and development of products and services;\ne) the potential consequences of failure due to the nature of the products and services;\nf) the level of control expected of the design and development process by customers and other relevant interested parties.",
+  "task": "Can you show me how you determine:\nRequirements essential for the type of products and services being designed and developed, including as applicable:\nFunctional & performance requirements;\nStatutory and regulatory requirements;\nStandards or codes of practice where there is a commitment to implement;\nInternal and external resources needed for the design and development of products and services;\nPotential consequences of failure;\nLevel of control expected of the design and development process by customers and other relevant parties."
+ },
+ {
+  "id": "iso9001-8.3.3-2",
+  "no": "8.3.3",
+  "title": "Design and development inputs",
+  "clause": "Inputs shall be adequate for design and development purposes, complete, and unambiguous. Conflicts among inputs shall be resolved.",
+  "task": "How do you determine that inputs are adequate, complete and unambiguous for design and development? How do you resolve conflicts among inputs?"
+ },
+ {
+  "id": "iso9001-8.3.4-1",
+  "no": "8.3.4",
+  "title": "Design and development controls",
+  "clause": "The controls applied to the design and development process shall ensure that:\na) the results to be achieved by the design and development activities are clearly defined;\nb) design and development reviews are conducted as planned;\nc) verification is conducted to ensure that the design and development outputs have met the design and development input requirements;\nd) validation is conducted to ensure that the resulting products and services are capable of meeting the requirements for the specified application or intended use (when known).",
+  "task": "How do controls that are applied to the design and development process ensure:\nResults achieved by design and development activities are clearly defined?\nDesign and development reviews are conducted as planned?\nOutputs meet the input requirements by verification/ Validation is conducted to ensure that the resulting products and services are capable of meeting the requirements for the specified application or intended use (when known)?"
+ },
+ {
+  "id": "iso9001-8.3.5-1",
+  "no": "8.3.5",
+  "title": "Design and development outputs",
+  "clause": "The organization shall ensure that design and development outputs:\na) meet the input requirements for design and development;\nb) are adequate for the subsequent processes for the provision of products and services;\nc) include or reference monitoring and measuring requirements, and acceptance criteria, as applicable;\nd) ensure products to be produced, or services to be provided, are fit for intended purpose and their safe and proper use.",
+  "task": "How do you ensure that design and development outputs:\nMeet the input requirements for design and development?\nAre adequate for the subsequent processes for the provision of products and services?\nInclude or reference monitoring and measuring requirements, and acceptance criteria, as applicable?\nEnsure products to be produced, or services to be provided, are fit for intended purpose and their safe and proper use?"
+ },
+ {
+  "id": "iso9001-8.3.5-2",
+  "no": "8.3.5",
+  "title": "Design and development outputs",
+  "clause": "The organization shall retain the documented information resulting from the design and development process.",
+  "task": "Show me the documented information which results from the design and development process.\n應備證據：Documented information from the design and development process."
+ },
+ {
+  "id": "iso9001-8.3.6-1",
+  "no": "8.3.6",
+  "title": "Design and development changes",
+  "clause": "The organization shall review, control and identify changes made to design inputs and design outputs during the design and development of products and\nservices or subsequently, to the extent that there is no adverse impact on conformity to requirements.",
+  "task": "How do you review, control and identify changes made to the design inputs and outputs during design and development of products and services ensuring no impact on conformity to requirements?"
+ },
+ {
+  "id": "iso9001-8.3.6-2",
+  "no": "8.3.6",
+  "title": "Design and development changes",
+  "clause": "Documented information on design and development changes shall be retained.",
+  "task": "Show me the documented information for design and development changes.\n應備證據：Documented information for design and development changes."
+ },
+ {
+  "id": "iso9001-8.4.1-1",
+  "no": "8.4.1",
+  "title": "General",
+  "clause": "The organization shall ensure that externally provided processes, products, and services conform to specified requirements.",
+  "task": "How do you ensure externally provided processes, products and services conform to specified requirements?"
+ },
+ {
+  "id": "iso9001-8.4.1-2",
+  "no": "8.4.1",
+  "title": "General",
+  "clause": "The organization shall apply the specified requirements for the control of externally provided products and services when:\na) products and services are provided by external providers for incorporation into the organization's own products and services;\nb) products and services are provided directly to the customer(s) by external providers on behalf of the organization;\nc) a process or part of a process is provided by an external provider as a result of a decision by the organization to outsource a process or function.",
+  "task": "Show me how you apply specified requirements for the control of externally provided products and services when:\nProducts and services are provided by external providers for incorporation into your own products and services;\nYou provide products and services directly to customers by external providers on your behalf;\nA process or part-process is provided by an external provider as a result of a decision to outsource a process or function."
+ },
+ {
+  "id": "iso9001-8.4.1-3",
+  "no": "8.4.1",
+  "title": "General",
+  "clause": "The organization shall establish and apply criteria for the evaluation, selection, monitoring of performance and re-evaluation of external providers based on their ability to provide processes or products and services in accordance with specified requirements.",
+  "task": "Show me how you establish and apply criteria for evaluation, selection, monitoring of performance and re-evaluation of external providers. How do you assess their ability to provide processes or products and services in accordance with specified requirements?"
+ },
+ {
+  "id": "iso9001-8.4.1-4",
+  "no": "8.4.1",
+  "title": "General",
+  "clause": "The organization shall retain appropriate documented information of the results of the evaluations, monitoring of the performance and re-evaluations of the external providers.",
+  "task": "What documented information do you have of the results of evaluations, monitoring of performance and re- evaluations of external providers?\n應備證據：Documented information of external providers' performance."
+ },
+ {
+  "id": "iso9001-8.4.2-1",
+  "no": "8.4.2",
+  "title": "Type and extent of control of external provision",
+  "clause": "In determining the type and extent of controls to be applied to the external provision of processes, products and services, the organization shall take into consideration:\na) the potential impact of the externally provided processes, products and services on the organization’s ability to consistently meet customer and applicable statutory and regulatory requirements;\nb) the perceived effectiveness of the controls applied by the external provider.",
+  "task": "How do you determine the controls applied to the external provision of processes, products and services and take into consideration:\na) The potential impact of the externally provided processes, products and services on the ability to consistently meet customer and applicable statutory and regulatory requirements?\nb) The perceived effectiveness of the controls applied by the external provider?"
+ },
+ {
+  "id": "iso9001-8.4.2-2",
+  "no": "8.4.2",
+  "title": "Type and extent of control of external provision",
+  "clause": "The organization shall establish and implement verification or other activities necessary to ensure the externally provided processes, products and services do not adversely affect the organization's ability to consistently deliver conforming products and services to its customers.",
+  "task": "What verification or other activities do you have to ensure externally provided processes, products and services do not adversely affect your ability to consistently deliver conforming products and services to your customers?"
+ },
+ {
+  "id": "iso9001-8.4.2-3",
+  "no": "8.4.2",
+  "title": "Type and extent of control of external provision",
+  "clause": "Processes or functions of the organization which have been outsourced to an external provider remain within the scope of the organization's quality management system; accordingly, the organization shall consider a) and b) above and define both the controls it intends to apply to the external provider and those it intends to apply to the resulting process output.",
+  "task": "When processes or functions have been outsourced to external providers, how do you consider a) and b) in 8.4.1 and how do you define the controls intended to be applied to the external provider and to the resulting process output?"
+ },
+ {
+  "id": "iso9001-8.4.3-1",
+  "no": "8.4.3",
+  "title": "Information for external providers",
+  "clause": "The organization shall communicate to external providers applicable requirements for the following:\na) the products and services to be provided or the processes to be performed on behalf of the organization;\nb) approval or release of products and services, methods, processes or equipment;\nc) competence of personnel, including necessary qualification;\nd) their interactions with the organization's quality management system;\ne) the control and monitoring of the external provide's performance to be applied by the organization;\nf) verification activities that the organization, or its customer, intends to perform at the external provider's premises.",
+  "task": "Show me how you communicate to external providers, applicable requirements for:\nProducts and services to be provided or the processes to be performed on behalf of the organization;\nApproval or release of products and services, methods, processes or equipment;\nCompetence of personnel, including necessary qualification;\nTheir interactions with the organization's quality management system;\nThe control and monitoring of the external provider's performance to be applied by the organization;\nVerification activities that the organization, or its customer, intends to perform at the external provider's premises."
+ },
+ {
+  "id": "iso9001-8.4.3-2",
+  "no": "8.4.3",
+  "title": "Information for external providers",
+  "clause": "The organization shall ensure the adequacy of specified requirements prior to their communication to the external provider.",
+  "task": "Before you communicate with external providers, how do you ensure the adequacy of specified requirements?"
+ },
+ {
+  "id": "iso9001-8.5.1-1",
+  "no": "8.5.1",
+  "title": "Control of production and service provision",
+  "clause": "The organization shall implement controlled conditions for production and service provision, including delivery and post-delivery activities.",
+  "task": "What controlled conditions do you have for production and service provision, including delivery and post-delivery activities?"
+ },
+ {
+  "id": "iso9001-8.5.1-2",
+  "no": "8.5.1",
+  "title": "Control of production and service provision",
+  "clause": "Controlled conditions shall include, as applicable:\na) the availability of documented information that defines the characteristics of the products and services;\nb) the availability of documented information that defines the activities to be performed and the results to be achieved;\nc) monitoring and measurement activities at appropriate stages to verify that criteria for control of processes and process outputs, and acceptance criteria for products and services, have been met.\nd) the use, and control of suitable infrastructure and process environment;\ne) the availability and use of suitable monitoring and measuring resources;\nf) the competence and, where applicable, required qualification of persons;\ng) the validation, and periodic revalidation, of the ability to achieve planned results of any process for production and service provision where the resulting output cannot be verified by subsequent monitoring or measurement;\nh) the implementation of products and services release, delivery and post-delivery activities.",
+  "task": "Can you show me controlled conditions for:\na) the availability of documented information defining the characteristics of the products and services;\nb) the availability of documented information defining the activities to be performed and the results to be achieved;\nc) monitoring and measurement activities at appropriate stages to verify that criteria for control of processes and process outputs, and acceptance criteria for products and services, have been met.\nd) the use, and control of suitable infrastructure and process environment;\ne) the availability and use of suitable monitoring and measuring resources;\nf) the competence and, where applicable, required qualification of persons;\ng) the validation, and periodic revalidation, of the ability to achieve planned results of any process for production and service provision where the resulting output cannot be verified by subsequent monitoring or measurement;\nh) the implementation of products and services release, delivery and post-delivery activities.\n應備證據：Documented information defining characteristics of the products and services"
+ },
+ {
+  "id": "iso9001-8.5.2-1",
+  "no": "8.5.2",
+  "title": "Identification and traceability",
+  "clause": "Where necessary to ensure conformity of products and services, the organization shall use suitable means to identify process outputs.",
+  "task": "What means do you use to identify process outputs to ensure conformity of products and services?"
+ },
+ {
+  "id": "iso9001-8.5.2-2",
+  "no": "8.5.2",
+  "title": "Identification and traceability",
+  "clause": "The organization shall identify the status of process outputs with respect to monitoring and measurement requirements throughout production and service provision.",
+  "task": "How do you identify the status of process outputs?"
+ },
+ {
+  "id": "iso9001-8.5.2-3",
+  "no": "8.5.2",
+  "title": "Identification and traceability",
+  "clause": "Where traceability is a requirement, the organization shall control the unique identification of the process outputs, and retain any documented information necessary to maintain traceability.",
+  "task": "How do you control the unique identification of process outputs, where applicable? What documented information do you retain?\n應備證據：Documented information of traceability, where required."
+ },
+ {
+  "id": "iso9001-8.5.3-1",
+  "no": "8.5.3",
+  "title": "Property belonging to customers or external providers",
+  "clause": "The organization shall exercise care with property belonging to the customer or external providers while it is under the organization's control or being used by the organization. The organization shall identify, verify, protect and safeguard the customer’s or external provider’s property provided for use or incorporation into the products and services.",
+  "task": "What care do you provide for customer or external provider’s property while under your control?\nHow do you identify, verify, protect and safeguard that property which is provided for use or incorporation into your products or services?"
+ },
+ {
+  "id": "iso9001-8.5.3-2",
+  "no": "8.5.3",
+  "title": "Property belonging to customers or external providers",
+  "clause": "When property of the customer or external provider is incorrectly used, lost, damaged or otherwise found to be unsuitable for use, the organization shall report this to the customer or external provider.",
+  "task": "What means do you use to report to the customer or external provider if their property is incorrectly used, lost, damaged or found to be unsuitable for use?"
+ },
+ {
+  "id": "iso9001-8.5.4-1",
+  "no": "8.5.4",
+  "title": "Preservation",
+  "clause": "The organization shall ensure preservation of process outputs during production and service provision, to the extent necessary to maintain conformity to requirements.",
+  "task": "How do you ensure preservation of process outputs during production and service provision to maintain conformity to product requirements?"
+ },
+ {
+  "id": "iso9001-8.5.5-1",
+  "no": "8.5.5",
+  "title": "Post-delivery activities",
+  "clause": "As applicable, the organization shall meet requirements for post-delivery activities associated with the products and services.",
+  "task": "How do you meet requirements for post- delivery activities associated with products and services?"
+ },
+ {
+  "id": "iso9001-8.5.5-2",
+  "no": "8.5.5",
+  "title": "Post-delivery activities",
+  "clause": "In determining the extent of post-delivery activities that are required, the organization shall consider:\na) the risks associated with the products and services;\nb) the nature, use and intended lifetime of the products and services;\nc) customer feedback;\nd) statutory and regulatory requirements.",
+  "task": "How do you determine:\nRisk;\nNature, use and intended lifetime;\nCustomer feedback;\nStatutory and Regulatory requirements, when determining the extent of post-delivery activities required with products and services?"
+ },
+ {
+  "id": "iso9001-8.5.6-1",
+  "no": "8.5.6",
+  "title": "Control of changes",
+  "clause": "The organization shall review and control unplanned changes essential for production or service provision to the extent necessary to ensure continuing conformity with specified requirements.",
+  "task": "How do you review and control unplanned changes to ensure continuing conformity with specified requirements?"
+ },
+ {
+  "id": "iso9001-8.5.6-2",
+  "no": "8.5.6",
+  "title": "Control of changes",
+  "clause": "The organization shall retain documented information describing the results of the review of changes, the personnel authorizing the change, and any necessary actions.",
+  "task": "What documented information can you show me which describes the results of reviews of changes, the personnel authorizing change and any necessary actions?\n應備證據：Documented information describing results of review of changes, personnel and actions."
+ },
+ {
+  "id": "iso9001-8.6-1",
+  "no": "8.6",
+  "title": "Release of products and services",
+  "clause": "The organization shall implement the planned arrangements at appropriate stages to verify that product and service requirements have been met. Evidence of conformity with the acceptance criteria shall be retained.",
+  "task": "Show me how planned arrangement have been implemented at appropriate stages to verify product and service requirements have been met. Show me what evidence you retain."
+ },
+ {
+  "id": "iso9001-8.6-2",
+  "no": "8.6",
+  "title": "Release of products and services",
+  "clause": "The release of products and services to the customer shall not proceed until the planned arrangements for verification of conformity have been satisfactorily completed, unless otherwise approved by a relevant authority and, as applicable, by the customer. Documented information shall provide traceability to the person(s) authorizing release of products and services for delivery to the customer.",
+  "task": "Show me how the release of products and services is held until planned arrangements for verification of conformity have been satisfactorily completed, unless approved by a relevant authority, or the customer if applicable. Show me documented information which shows traceability to the person authorizing release of products and services.\n應備證據：Documented information providing traceability, authorizing release of products and services."
+ },
+ {
+  "id": "iso9001-8.7-1",
+  "no": "8.7",
+  "title": "Control of non-conforming process outputs, products and services",
+  "clause": "The organization shall ensure process outputs, products and services that do not conform to requirements are identified and controlled to prevent their unintended use or delivery.",
+  "task": "How do you identify and control process outputs, products and services that do not conform to requirements and prevent their unintended use or delivery?"
+ },
+ {
+  "id": "iso9001-8.7-2",
+  "no": "8.7",
+  "title": "Control of non-conforming process outputs, products and services",
+  "clause": "The organization shall take appropriate corrective action based on the nature of the nonconformity and its impact on the conformity of products and services. This applies also to nonconforming products and services detected after delivery of the products or during the provision of the service.",
+  "task": "What appropriate corrective actions are taken based on the nature of the nonconformity and its impact on the conformity of products and services? How do you apply this to nonconformity detected after delivery?"
+ },
+ {
+  "id": "iso9001-8.7-3",
+  "no": "8.7",
+  "title": "Control of non-conforming process outputs, products and services",
+  "clause": "As applicable, the organization shall deal with nonconforming process outputs, products and services in one or more of the following ways:\na) correction;\nb) segregation, containment, return or suspension of provision of products and services;\nc) informing the customer;\nd) obtaining authorization for:\n- use “as-is’;\n- release, continuation or re-provision of the products and services;\n- acceptance under concession.",
+  "task": "How you deal with nonconforming process outputs, products and services in terms of:\nCorrection;\nSegregation, containment, return or suspension of provision of products and services?\nInforming the customer?\nObtaining authorization for use as-is?\nRelease, continuation or re-provision of the products and service?\nAcceptance under concession?"
+ },
+ {
+  "id": "iso9001-8.7-4",
+  "no": "8.7",
+  "title": "Control of non-conforming process outputs, products and services",
+  "clause": "Where nonconforming process outputs, products and services are corrected, conformity to the requirements shall be verified.",
+  "task": "How do you verify conformance where process outputs, products and services are corrected following nonconformance?"
+ },
+ {
